89724658", "artifacts_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/actions/runs/44289909182/artifacts", "cancel_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/actions/runs/44289909182/cancel", "rerun_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/actions/runs/44289909182/rerun", "previous_attempt_url": null, "workflow_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/actions/workflows/138792004", "head_commit": {"id": "111f2088a48a1e6d9ee9f867dfc5f0ff37873c21", "tree_id": "3da234a9b5f1040f1b5dbc4ca36018af4d0ef40c", "message": "[jax-buildcop] Reduce scipy_stats_test_cpu_x32 generated cases to 40\n\n`scipy_stats_test_cpu_x32` runs 6,091 parameterized test cases (121-122 per shard across 50 shards) under the default `--jax_num_generated_cases=90`. A prior change set `--jax_num_generated_cases=40` under `\"cpu\"` in `backend_variant_args`, which only matches `scipy_stats_test_cpu`. Because `scipy_stats_test_cpu_x32` matches the `\"cpu_x32\"` config key, it kept running 57% more tests per shard than `scipy_stats_test_cpu`. With assertions enabled, it regularly timed out at the 300s medium limit.\n\nAdd `\"cpu_x32\": [\"--jax_num_generated_cases=40\"]` to `backend_variant_args` for `scipy_stats_test` (matching `sparse_test`). This reduces `scipy_stats_test_cpu_x32` to 3,607 cases (72-73 per shard) and cuts shard wall time by more than half (median 59.2s, p90 79.3s, max 97.8s across 100 shards).\n\nPiperOrigin-RevId: 1024443038", "timestamp": "2026-11-18T09:15:01Z", "author": {"name": "jax authors", "email": "google-ml-automation@google.com"}, "committer": {"name": "jax authors", "email": "google-ml-automation@google.com"}}, "repository": {"id": 154739597, "node_id": "MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNTQ3Mzk1OTc=", "name": "jax", "full_name": "jax-ml/jax", "private": false, "owner": {"login": "jax-ml", "id": 58486408, "node_id": "MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjU4NDg2NDA4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58486408?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/user